			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"凱亞"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 401111301,
					"content": "喲，還有什麼想聊的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401111302,
						401111306,
						401111310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 401111302,
					"content": "關於「七聖召喚」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401111303
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401111303,
					"content": "最近這卡牌可真是熱門，簡直像成了大家生活的一部分。到處都能看到有人玩。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401111304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 401111304,
					"content": "而且，還真有人為了保持清醒的頭腦打牌，把酒都給戒了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401111305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 401111305,
					"content": "嘖嘖，迪奧娜聽到後應該會很高興吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401111306,
						401111310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 401111306,
					"content": "騎士團的大家…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401111307
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401111307,
					"content": "放心放心，大家都很好。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401111308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 401111308,
					"content": "我曾經試過拉琴團長一起玩，結果剛打到一半她就被人叫走了，殘局還是由我打完的，唉，真是沒辦法。只能說是「各司其職」了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401111309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 401111309,
					"content": "不過看到這次大賽辦得這麼成功，大家都樂在其中，她應該也能鬆一口氣吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401111302,
						401111310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "凱亞"
				},
				{
					"id": 401111310,
					"content": "改天再聊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						401111311
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 401111311,
					"content": "#好呀，有機會還想和{F#妳}{M#你}也來一局「七聖召喚」呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "凱亞"
				}
			]
		},
		{
